<tr>
<th colspan="2" id="machikane">1/35 マチカネワニ骨格</th></tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/machikane001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/machikane001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/nonmaker/TURTLEBREAK/img/machikane001.jpg" --></a></td><td>
